ERROR: /home/qktttt/mpich-install is not configured for multi-node PALS launch.
MPICH configure: --prefix=/home/qktttt/mpich-install

On Polaris, Hydra cannot launch across nodes because compute-node SSH is blocked.
PALS can launch across nodes, but this MPICH build must be configured with Cray PMI, e.g.:
  --with-pmi=pmi2 --with-pmi2=${CRAY_PMI_PREFIX} --with-pm=no

The 1-node script can still use Hydra with '-launcher fork'.
